      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-quiet\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 16V4m-5 5 5-5 5 5M5 16v5h14v-5\"/></svg>Import</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-quiet{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;min-height:38px;padding:9px 17px;border-radius:22px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:450;white-space:nowrap;background:transparent;color:var(--ink,#eff0ed);border:0;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s,opacity .15s;}.ds-button-quiet:hover:not(:disabled){background:#ffffff0a;}.ds-button-quiet:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9fd3b5;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-quiet:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-quiet{transition:none!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Action",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-text",
      "description": "Low-emphasis sage action used in the expression library.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-text-action\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg>New expression</button>",
      "css": ".ds-text-action{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 0;background:transparent;border:0;color:#c3ddb2;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:450;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s,opacity .15s;}.ds-text-action:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.ds-text-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9fd3b5;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-text-action:disabled{opacity:.4;cursor:not-allowed;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-text-action{transition:none!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "text-field",
      "description": "Dark single-line field with explicit keyboard focus.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-expression-name\">Expression name</label><input id=\"ds-expression-name\" class=\"ds-text-field\" value=\"Idle\"/>",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#b3b8ad;margin-bottom:8px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-text-field{width:100%;height:37px;padding:7px 10px;background:#282d25;border:1px solid #ffffff11;border-radius:10px;color:#e3e6e0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;}.ds-text-field:focus{border-color:#a2c28b;background:#2a3026;}.ds-text-field:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #a2c28b;outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspector Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "inspector-tab",
      "description": "Four quiet icon-over-label choices with a tonal active state.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-inspector-nav\" aria-label=\"Inspector\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-inspector-tab\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5Z\"/></svg><span>Character</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-inspector-tab\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 10h.01M16 10h.01M8 15q4 4 8 0M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20\"/></svg><span>Expressions</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-inspector-tab\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h16v16H4ZM4 8h16M8 4v4m8-4v4m-6 4 5 3-5 3Z\"/></svg><span>Animations</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-inspector-tab\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3v12m-5-5 5 5 5-5M5 16v5h14v-5\"/></svg><span>Export</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-inspector-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:2px;height:77px;padding:13px 16px 10px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#222522 0%,#181b18 80%);border-bottom:1px solid #ffffff08;}.ds-inspector-tab{flex:1;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:5px;height:58px;padding:8px 0;border:0;border-radius:14px;background:transparent;color:#b1b8ac;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:400;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s,opacity .15s;}.ds-inspector-tab svg{flex-shrink:0;}.ds-inspector-tab:hover{color:#fff;background:#ffffff04;}.ds-inspector-tab[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{color:#d7ebcd;background:#ffffff06;}.ds-inspector-tab:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9fd3b5;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-inspector-nav,.ds-inspector-tab{transition:none!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Expression Option Chips",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "option-chip",
      "description": "Wrapping mouth or eye options retain individual selected fills.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-option-chips\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-option-chip\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Round</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-option-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Soft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-option-chip\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Closed</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-option-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin:8px 0 13px;}.ds-option-chip{padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid #ffffff0b;border-radius:17px;background:#272f22;color:#b3b8ad;text-transform:capitalize;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;transition:background .15s,border-color .15s,color .15s,opacity .15s;}.ds-option-chip[aria-pressed=\"true\"]{background:#3d4d32;border-color:#b1cf9366;color:#e4f3d6;}.ds-option-chip:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9fd3b5;outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-option-chip,.ds-option-chips{transition:none!important;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Expression Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "The inspector\u2019s quiet charcoal material and regular heading. This panel sample shows its shipped heading and padding; character previews remain the shared WebGL renderer.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-inspector-panel\"><div class=\"ds-panel-heading\"><div><h1>Expressions</h1><p>Small gestures. Plenty of personality.</p></div><span class=\"ds-count-badge\">10</span></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-inspector-panel{padding:24px;border-radius:26px;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#222522 0%,#181b18 80%);box-shadow:0 8px 16px #15181520;color:var(--ink,#eff0ed);font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;}.ds-panel-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;margin-bottom:16px;}.ds-panel-heading h1{margin:0;font-size:27px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.25;}.ds-panel-heading p{margin:7px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#b3b8ad;line-height:1.6;}.ds-count-badge{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:25px;height:25px;border-radius:8px;background:#ffffff07;color:#b3b8ad;font-size:12px;}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Character Studio",
    "overview": "ClipLab is a quiet dark studio: a graphite canvas, a transparent header with the supplied white logo, and separate charcoal cards leave room for the authored character. Regular sans-serif headings, compact controls, sage selections, and a few white action surfaces keep the surrounding interface restrained.\n\nThe character carries the expressive range. Real geometry supports smooth two-color fills and sharply divided toon lighting, with circular eyes, substantial mouths, and optional animated details. The stage, expression library, and timeline share the character renderer so that the same face reads consistently while it is edited, sequenced, and exported. This refresh retains the established studio identity and character principles while replacing the earlier pale surfaces and blue action language with the user-approved dark world.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Graphite gutters separate independently rounded charcoal surfaces.",
      "The transparent header carries the supplied white ClipLab logo.",
      "White highlights primary actions and the active timeline beat; sage identifies quieter editing states.",
      "Compact regular sans-serif type supports a character-led interface.",
      "Circular facial geometry and crisp toon bands remain consistent across rendering contexts."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The White Anchor Rule",
        "body": "Keep the primary action and current timeline beat white while using the shipped sage variants for quieter editor selection. Character colors remain authored content.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Type Rule",
        "body": "Use size, spacing, and modest weight changes to separate controls and headings. Keep the expressive character as the visual focus.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Visible Gutter Rule",
        "body": "Preserve graphite space between the preview, sequence, and inspector cards. Keep the header transparent so the workspace reads as independent surfaces.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Crisp Lighting Rule",
        "body": "Blend character body colors smoothly while keeping toon lighting boundaries hard. The camera-fixed candle mode uses four slightly offset radial bands; the selectable directional mode uses three normal-based bands. The optional ground shadow has a crisp elliptical boundary. Do not transfer this character-lighting constraint into a ban on the interface's soft ambient shadows.",
        "section": "elevation"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Round Face Rule",
        "body": "Start from circular dot eyes and half-circle arcs, with rounded stroke ends and substantial mouth contours. Keep facial proportions relative to the authored body and preserve the circular geometry when the face is mapped to it.",
        "section": "shapes"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** preserve the graphite canvas, transparent header, supplied white logo, and visible spacing between the three studio cards.",
      "**Do** use white for primary actions and the active timeline beat, with the existing sage variants for quieter editor states.",
      "**Do** use the quiet UI type hierarchy and maintain legible helper text and keyboard focus.",
      "**Do** keep character colors editable and preserve smooth fills alongside crisp lighting bands.",
      "**Do** keep circular base eyes, transparent circular cheek cutouts, substantial mouth contours, and eased supporting details consistent across the shared renderer.",
      "**Do** choose facial detail from displayed CSS size and preserve authored pose data when toggling view controls."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** reintroduce the obsolete pale inspector, blue primary-action palette, or an opaque header bar into this dark studio.",
      "**Don't** merge the three studio cards into one continuous framed surface or apply panel shadows to every inner control.",
      "**Don't** replace the supplied logo with typeset lettering or create a separate display treatment from the compact UI headings.",
      "**Don't** blur toon-band or ground-shadow boundaries; soft ambient interface shadows and smooth body-color gradients remain valid parts of this world.",
      "**Don't** enlarge default facial detail to compensate for an incorrectly scaled preview, or paint cheek cutouts with a flat sampled body color."
    ]
  }
}
